Z||000010||FieroSTETZ||02-02-2000||08:42 PM||||wkd, are you the other fiero doc? i want to come in there, but i have not nearly the money to get anything done after i get out there. kieth said he was installing a northstar, how is that going? well, can you gimme some help? my headlights, when the switch is pressed, turn on, all 3 relays click, but the motors do nothing. they dont whine or anything... what do i do to help diagnose this? also, i get a rampant "ajar" light.. could that affect the headlights? umm.. keith said that by blocking off my egr tube, i could help to figure out how to drop my idle below 2000 (possible cracked) is there any way to get the intake manifold end off without removing the entire manifold? thanks much for any help that ANYONE can give me.||||reg||1
